# Whiteboard

Copy this file to `WHITEBOARD.md` (that name is gitignored, this
`.example` one is what ships with the template) to start using it.

Live cross-project coordination scratchpad — gitignored, reflects the
current moment only, never worth version-controlling. See
`.claude/harness/workflow.md`'s "Cross-project tickets" section for the
protocol this supports.

Format per entry:

```
## <ticket-number> — <short title>

Projects: project:<a>, project:<b>
Contract: <what's actually shared — an API shape, a schema field, an event>
Status: <which side has landed, which is next>
```

Remove the entry once the ticket is merged/closed — this file is a
snapshot, not a log.

---

No active cross-project tickets.
